+"""REINFORCE with importance-sampling corrections, and a sampler-centered score.
 
 Every correction is REINFORCE with a detached weight w(r) on the ratio
 r = p/q of trainer (p) to sampler (q) probabilities, per token or per
 sequence.
+
+The score of every sampled token is centered under the sampler's next-token
+distribution q rather than the trainer's p: the per-token gradient with
+respect to the trainer logits is A * (e_y - q) instead of A * (e_y - p).
+E_{y~q}[e_y - p] = q - p != 0, so with the plain score any non-zero
+conditional mean of the advantage leaks a systematic drift A_bar * (q - p)
+into the update; with e_y - q it has zero mean under the distribution that
+actually generated the tokens. See REPORT.md. Always on; uses the sampler's
+top-k / full logprobs when present (sampler.vocab_logprobs), and a two-bin
+{sampled token, rest} version from the sampled-token logprob alone otherwise.
 """
 import math
